+     * (`cbnz` on the key, then `cbz TMP4, &L1Miss` on the host pointer);
+     * this is that second test, restored here.
+     *
+     * On a miss, execution falls into the DispatcherLoopTop path below with
+     * State.rip set to the target, so an unbacked guest address is resolved by
